### Get Reset Password Token
# @name token
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/email/reset-password/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### Reset Password
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/email/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{token.response.body.token}}",
  "newPassword": "newpassword123"
}